{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"ayu-mirage-like","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Mirage Dusk","description":"A dusky mid-tone dark theme with warm orange accents.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Mirage Dusk","path":"themes/ayu-mirage-like.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/ayu-mirage-like.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Mirage Dusk\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#1f2430\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#cccac2\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#1a1f29\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#171b24\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#171b24\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#171b24\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#2a3040\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#33415e\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#2a3040\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#1a1f29\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#171b24\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#ffcc66\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#ffcc66\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#ffcc66\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#33415e\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#2a304080\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#ffcc66\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#171b24\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#f28779\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#87d96c\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#ffcc66\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#f28779\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#6e7c8e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d5ff80\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#dfbfff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffad66\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#73d0ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffd173\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#dfbfff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#cccac2\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#5ccfe6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffd173\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f28779\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Mirage Dusk\n\nA dusky mid-tone dark theme with warm orange accents.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Mirage Dusk** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Ayu Mirage palette (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#1f2430` |\n| Text | `#cccac2` |\n| Accent | `#ffcc66` |\n| Keywords | `#ffad66` |\n| Strings | `#d5ff80` |\n| Functions | `#ffd173` |\n| Types | `#73d0ff` |\n| Comments | `#6e7c8e` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}